##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.0
# Spec 039 (DeterminismHarness_detects): random() shading, so a change of seed changes the
# image. The harness self-test renders it twice single-threaded with seed 0 and seed 1
# (test_depth_determinism --config-prepends) and must report the two as different (exit code 1):
# a real, deterministic difference. Until Phase 9 the difference was the Legacy sampler's
# thread-dependent draws (no sampler option, no pin), which no longer exist.
version 3.03
Hider "reyes" "jitter" [0]
PixelSamples 1 1
PixelFilter "box" 1 1
Quantize "rgba" 0 0 0 0
Display "determinism-harness-noisy.tif" "file" "rgba"
Projection "perspective"
Format 320 240 1
Clipping 0.1 100
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
  Surface "random_probe"
  Sphere 1.8 -1.8 1.8 360
WorldEnd
